# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Zydit TTS — environment schema (all variables are OPTIONAL)
#
# The app degrades gracefully when nothing is set: it runs fully in guest /
# local mode and prompts for an endpoint on first generation. Copy this file
# to `.env.local` for development, or set these in Cloudflare Pages →
# Settings → Environment variables (Production + Preview) for deployment.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# TTS engine — OpenAI-compatible speech endpoint (e.g. an ElevenLabs gateway).
# Base URL only: "/v1/audio/speech" is appended automatically if missing.
# Users can also override this at runtime in the in-app API Settings dialog.
VITE_TTS_API_BASE_URL=""

# Firebase Auth — leave blank to run in guest-only mode (fully functional).
# Setup guide: docs/FIREBASE_SETUP.md
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=""
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=""
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=""
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=""
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=""
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=""
